    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Capacity question",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "> **Derived presentation view.** Grafana is not evidence authority. The importer verifies the sealed bundle first. Use the provenance table to locate its checksum manifest. Missing evidence stays **MISSING**.\n\nThe matrix isolates history state and WAL envelope. A = clean/current WAL, B = accumulated/current WAL, C = clean/larger WAL, D = accumulated/larger WAL. Rows remain **MISSING** until a sealed bundle is imported.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Admission stability matrix A/B/C/D",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "openpoke-prometheus"
      },
      "description": "The first imported A run fails. B, C, and D have no imported evidence yet.",
